### ext5 (.105): when did producer 3433 get created? (frigate restarts producer on consumer demand; check restarts)
journalctl -u frigate --no-pager --since "2026-09-16 18:00:00" | grep -iE "restart|reconnect|new producer" | grep -vE "exterior_4" | tail -15
### ext5 (.105) audio-worker lines (AudioWorker sink clogged class) all day
journalctl -u frigate --no-pager --since "2026-09-16 00:00:00" | grep -iE "AudioWorker|sink clogged" | tail -10
### ext5 (.105) ffmpeg detect/record lines 19:30-19:40 local (the freeze onset)
journalctl -u frigate --no-pager --since "2026-09-16 19:28:00" --until "2026-09-16 19:45:00" | grep "exterior_5" | head -20
